"name": "guider", "link": 4026, "label": "guider", "type": "GUIDER", "localized_name": "guider"}, {"name": "sampler", "link": 4027, "label": "sampler", "type": "SAMPLER", "localized_name": "sampler"}, {"name": "sigmas", "link": 4024, "label": "sigmas", "type": "SIGMAS", "localized_name": "sigmas"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 4023, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced", "title": "IC 3-step refine · CFG 1", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SamplerCustomAdvanced"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [4031], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}], "size": [220, 80], "pos": [3349.0181847291024, 87.3261606950557], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 4028, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 4034, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 23, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# Open-H3-Regenerate-2K-IC · ComfyUI\n\nThis graph runs the **IC (in-context)** variant with native ComfyUI H3 nodes:\n\n1. Load a 768P MiniMax-H3 draft (124 frames / about 5 s).\n2. The draft becomes `<Video 1>` in **MiniMax H3 Reference to Video**.\n3. The same draft is VAE-encoded and passed through the official 3D latent upscaler.\n4. `up3` applies the official sigmas `0.834942, 0.696852, 0.468753, 0`.\n5. The result is decoded with the official fast H3 VAE and muxed with the draft's original audio.\n\n**Required converted LoRA:** `minimax_h3_open_regenerate_2k_ic_comfy_bf16.safetensors`\nUse `tools/convert_ic_lora.py` on the official `open_h3_regenerate_2k_ic_lora.safetensors`.\n\n**Caption:** enter the original MiniMax-H3 prompt that generated the draft. Empty is valid.\n\n**Tip:** if VRAM is tight, replace the reference model with the pruned INT8\n`minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` and lower the target to\n1920×1088. The official IC target defaults to 2560×1440.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "README / usage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [660, 390], "pos": [-920.4687731228469, -16.123014979171376], "id": 26, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Note"}, "order": 9, "widgets_values_named": {"text": "# Open-H3-Regenerate-2K-IC · ComfyUI\n\nThis graph runs the **IC (in-context)** variant with native ComfyUI H3 nodes:\n\n1. Load a 768P MiniMax-H3 draft (124 frames / about 5 s).\n2. The draft becomes `<Video 1>` in **MiniMax H3 Reference to Video**.\n3. The same draft is VAE-encoded and passed through the official 3D latent upscaler.\n4. `up3` applies the official sigmas `0.834942, 0.696852, 0.468753, 0`.\n5. The result is decoded with the official fast H3 VAE and muxed with the draft's original audio.\n\n**Required converted LoRA:** `minimax_h3_open_regenerate_2k_ic_comfy_bf16.safetensors`\nUse `tools/convert_ic_lora.py` on the official `open_h3_regenerate_2k_ic_lora.safetensors`.\n\n**Caption:** enter the original MiniMax-H3 prompt that generated the draft. Empty is valid.\n\n**Tip:** if VRAM is tight, replace the reference model with the pruned INT8\n`minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` and lower the target to\n1920×1088. The official IC target defaults to 2560×1440.\n"}}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "Filenames", "label": "Filenames", "type": "VHS_FILENAMES", "localized_name": "Filenames"}], "size": [387.61468509934184, 578.7832603683798], "pos": [3601.4851190405057, 72.45964526070716], "widgets_values": {"save_output": true, "filename_prefix": "AnimateDiff", "loop_count": 0, "pix_fmt": "yuv420p", "save_metadata": true, "crf": 19, "trim_to_audio": false, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"storageProvider": "tos", "